{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>למען, כי רב הוא</b> — even though it is great, like <b>כי עם קשה עורף כי חטאתי לך</b> (for it is a stiff-necked people, for I have sinned to you). And some say: למען אודיע שמך (in order that I make Your name known). And the correct interpretation: that it be known that Your name is forgiveness."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:31.219177169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}